        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>From one egg to an unstoppable swarm.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong><i><u>ant colony</u></i></strong> to accumulate maximum resources in this super <strong>idle</strong>, <strong><i><u>drawn entirely by hand</u></i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ants -&gt; get food -&gt; buy more ants -&gt; get more food -&gt; ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955090/extras/2792f075e69b6f2dc419d9f97c671547.poster.avif?t=1757704348\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955090/extras/2792f075e69b6f2dc419d9f97c671547.webm?t=1757704348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955090/extras/2792f075e69b6f2dc419d9f97c671547.mp4?t=1757704348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐜 <strong>Build your ant colony and watch it thrive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch eggs, grow your swarm, and upgrade your terrarium to boost production. Unlock powerful bonuses, prestige for permanent upgrades, and push your colony further with every run.</p>",
